  sentences:
  - name: Mother
    text: "This was my daughter, yes\u2026 No, she is, forever will be. I thought
      I did most of it already but\u2026 can never be too much?"
  - name: Mother
    text: "But please - be careful. We\u2019re about to celebrate, I came here to
      make space for her."
